        "content": "## Jarvis agents (Lesson 09)\nJarvis Live asks this workflow two things:\n1. **Which agents exist?** (GET jarvis-agents) → the list in *Agent list*. It's empty until upcoming lessons add agents.\n2. **Do this task** (POST jarvis-live-tool) → each agent gets its own branch.\n\nTo add an agent later: add it to *Agent list*, route its tasks to its branch, and end the branch with *Respond to Webhook* returning `{ \"ok\": true, \"result\": \"…\" }`.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "b2c0d1e2-0000-4a1b-9c01-000000000000",
      "name": "How this works",
